%%label II. Larghetto
%%note F major. Two flutes in thirds over hushed strings; a restless middle that strays into flat keys; the close turns to the dominant of A minor for the finale.
X:1
T:C. P. E. Bach’s Missing Symphony
T:II. Larghetto
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of C. P. E. Bach
M:3/4
L:1/8
Q:"Larghetto" 1/4=50
%%score [fl ob bn] hn [v1 v2 va vc cb] hpd
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:fl clef=treble name="Fl. I, II"
